  "Title": "Professor Pradines Features in Documentary",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Embarquement: Egypte - Le Caire, le renouveau du quartier de Darb Al-Ahmar",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClassB6FAF8AECE2448238E29D22E2D8B6235\"><p>Embarquement&#58; Egypte - Le Caire, le renouveau du quartier de Darb Al-Ahmar features ISMC's Professor Pradines and looks at Cairo - Africa's second most populated city and examines its rich history centring on the Darb Al Ahmar quarter. &#160;Professor Pradines has led a number of excavations in Cairo most notably as&#160;Director of Excavations of the Walls of Cairo.</p><p>The documentary is&#160;directed by Sabine Heaulme and&#160;was produced by the Aga Khan Trust for Culture and TV5 Monde.</p><p>The documentary is available to view&#160;<a href=\"https&#58;//vimeo.com/295387353\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></p></div>",
